<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Tatmadaw continues cross-border strikes, bombing a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while resistance drones hit a Christian Bible school in Karen State, killing three female students. The military announced special elections in Sagaing, Chin and Shan despite ongoing fighting, and returned from a Laos delegation to join the HADR‑2026 disaster-relief exercise, repurposing dead Starlink terminals for targeting. Myanmar’s military rebranded its control as federalism, while Thailand deployed F‑16 fighter jets to the border and China’s demand for green stones is reported to fuel the conflict. Displaced people in Rakhine face severe livelihood challenges and cholera deaths, and the names of Myanmar Air Force officials responsible for deadly airstrikes on Kyauktaw’s Indian market and Paletwa’s Chaungsone were released.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOSzNoR3IyTjZwLWhrTFBXMXNPdjVFanV4WlVoUTBUaDVxOXNRUmxOOEJmUVNJSUJEZ05JbVJfdXdaaE11V0cxRVpBbGxhd2trR2x6OHhKT0hubWhiNlIxdTE2Z1BPdVZ4YlBIU0xLYno3aDhFNl9RcFRIclJyLTVSRUY5NndQMVBhQnhabmQ5NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;East Asia Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNRGVwa3FQeDZnWGxXdUZmaWZ3UjJMOG5tbkdNbFVmc3hXY284VWJ3ckFHeE1FWXhiazRpcHZMWGsxZUZNUk9xc01pVXc5WW1kME1YZEM2Ykg4UUt5SnNZVXJoM3pCTi1zVmgzcVFXenVXbjRWaUQ2RUVydTRidG53RFNEenpNSVVjSDZBamhlbXlWQS1hc0VmZl84OUU3THBzR2JqT1dXVDVMMHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lowy Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOS2tCdDlCc1Job2ZRZFU0Q0tjTjRCcV9wNVhDVlVVWlZDcllBTW5QUW10bmFzTEg4MEdGNUViQ1hDUkpKLURVYTljT1dtanMyVTQtbmE2T3ZrY29HcVdPN3B2dVhLS2pvYTRjUWg1dEFxVTRWZ3pva000VmZxNTlMT